OL,3,GNEWSAPrescot Cables FC could be forced
OL,4,Ato relocate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Merseyside non-league football club
OL,7,Fcould be forced to relocate as soon as
OL,8,Fnext season because its main stand is
OL,9,F"nearing the end of its life."
OL,11,FPrescot Cables FC, who play in the
OL,12,FNorthern Premier League West, said it
OL,13,Fmay need to consider moving out of the
OL,14,Ftown due to concerns about the stand at
OL,15,FValerie Park.
OL,17,FKnowsley Council said the stand would
OL,18,Fneed to be rebuilt or replaced within
OL,19,Fthree years.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
